User = normal customer

Jo app use karta hai:

User kya kar sakta hai:
Register / Login
Products dekhna
Cart me add karna
Order place karna
Apne orders dekhna
Profile update karna
Simple example:

👉 Tum Flipkart use kar rahe ho = tum USER ho

🧑‍💼 ADMIN kya hota hai?

Admin = system owner / seller side control

Admin kya kar sakta hai:
Product add karna
Product update/delete karna
All users dekhna
All orders manage karna
Order status change karna (SHIPPED, DELIVERED)
Simple example:

👉 Flipkart wala jo products upload karta hai = ADMIN